OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy but dry across the region
OL,7,Fthrough the evening. Dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells lingering overnight with patchy
OL,9,Fmist possible in the east while cloud
OL,10,Fslowly thickens in the far west. A
OL,11,Fmostly mild night with light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FDry to start with cloud
OL,14,Fbuilding through the morning. A band
OL,15,Fof rain, locally thundery with hail
OL,16,Fand strong gusts, passes across during
OL,17,Fthe afternoon. Turning dry and cold
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
